# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot the site-averaged magnetization of each method across the sweep across Ising rotation angles. Exponential extrapolation recovers the exact magnetization within its error bars, while linear extrapolation removes much of the bias but consistently undershoots, because the true decay is exponential. The square-root fit overshoots badly.\n"
msgstr "Plot magnetisasi rata-rata situs dari tiap metode sepanjang sapuan sudut rotasi Ising. Ekstrapolasi eksponensial memulihkan magnetisasi eksak dalam batas error bar-nya, sedangkan ekstrapolasi linear menghilangkan sebagian besar bias tetapi konsisten meremehkan nilainya, karena peluruhan sebenarnya bersifat eksponensial. Fit akar kuadrat melenceng jauh ke atas.\n"

